  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Liwinza Honey Production Capacity Building Project</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Sector: Agriculture - Honey Production and Processing., Beneficiaries: Liwinza Honey Producers and Marketing Cooperative (LHPMC) is a predominantly women owned group comprising of 19 women and 4 men., Members of Liwinza produce and honey and other products. The group is based in Balaka District Nantchengwa village and started in 2006. The Cooperative was registered in 2015. Since inception, the farmers have been growing the income the business in order to improve their livelihoods, but they need capital boost to improve the way the business is run in order to have good standards. The USADF is a capacity building grant that will support the Liwinza families and help them to become food secure.</narrative>
  </description>
